{
  "name": "InOut AI - 51 Human Reply Return",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "contract-note",
      "name": "Input Output Contract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -720,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Human Reply Return\n\nValidates staff identity, loads the active handoff, sends a staff-approved WhatsApp reply, saves the staff message, updates conversation state, and closes or continues the handoff.\n\nInput: Conversation id, handoff id, staff id/role, approved reply, customer phone, and close/continue instruction.\nOutput: { success: true, providerMessageId: \"\", handoffStatus: \"\", conversationId: \"\" }\n\nShared Input Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"correlationId\": \"\",\n  \"messageId\": \"\",\n  \"conversationId\": \"\",\n  \"customerId\": \"\",\n  \"customerPhone\": \"\",\n  \"detectedLanguage\": \"\",\n  \"intent\": \"\",\n  \"payload\": {}\n}\n```\n\nShared Output Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n  \"data\": {},\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"correlationId\": \"\",\n    \"workflow\": \"\",\n    \"durationMs\": 0\n  }\n}\n```\n\nRequired fields:\n- correlationId\n- workflowExecutionId\n- idempotencyKey when writing\n\nRules:\n- Only verified staff may return a human reply.\n- Send one WhatsApp reply to one customer recipient only.\n- Never send internal notes, prompts, or unapproved draft text to the customer.\n- Keep AI locked until the handoff is explicitly closed by authorized staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workflow-input",
      "name": "Workflow Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -680,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "validate-staff-identity",
      "name": "Validate Staff Identity",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -760,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{($vars.SERVICE_API_BASE_URL || 'MISSING_SERVICE_API_BASE_URL').replace(/\\/$/, '').replace(/\\/api\\/v1$/i, '') + '/api/v1/staff/validate'}}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{'Bearer ' + ($vars.N8N_API_KEY || '')}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Correlation-Id",
              "value": "={{$json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{($json.idempotencyKey || $json.idempotency_key || $json.wamid || $json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id || $execution.id)}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { staffId: $json.staffId || $json.staff_id, staffRole: $json.staffRole || $json.role, handoffId: $json.handoffId || $json.handoff_id, conversationId: $json.conversationId || $json.conversation_id, action: 'human_reply_return', correlationId: $json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id } }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "load-active-handoff",
      "name": "Load Active Handoff",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -500,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{($vars.SERVICE_API_BASE_URL || 'MISSING_SERVICE_API_BASE_URL').replace(/\\/$/, '').replace(/\\/api\\/v1$/i, '') + '/api/v1/human-handoffs/' + encodeURIComponent($('Workflow Input').first().json.handoffId || $('Workflow Input').first().json.handoff_id || 'active') + '?conversationId=' + encodeURIComponent($('Workflow Input').first().json.conversationId || $('Workflow Input').first().json.conversation_id || '')'}}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{'Bearer ' + ($vars.N8N_API_KEY || '')}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Correlation-Id",
              "value": "={{$json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{($json.idempotencyKey || $json.idempotency_key || $json.wamid || $json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id || $execution.id)}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": false,
        "contentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{$json}}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "prepare-human-reply",
      "name": "Prepare Human Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -240,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const input = $('Workflow Input').first().json;\nconst handoff = $('Load Active Handoff').first().json.body?.data || {};\nconst text = String(input.approvedReply || input.approved_reply || input.message || '').trim();\nif (!text) throw new Error('approved human reply is required');\nconst customerPhone = String(input.customerPhone || input.customer_phone || handoff.customerPhone || handoff.phone || '').replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\nreturn [{ json: { conversationId: input.conversationId || input.conversation_id || handoff.conversationId || '', handoffId: input.handoffId || input.handoff_id || handoff.handoffId || handoff.id || '', customerPhone, approvedReply: text, closeHandoff: Boolean(input.closeHandoff || input.close_handoff), staffId: input.staffId || input.staff_id, staffRole: input.staffRole || input.role, correlationId: input.correlationId || input.correlation_id || 'corr_' + Date.now(), oneRecipientOnly: true } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send-whatsapp-reply",
      "name": "Send WhatsApp Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        20,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "={{$vars.WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID}}",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{$json.customerPhone}}",
        "textBody": "={{$json.approvedReply}}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "whatsAppApi": {
          "id": "replace_with_n8n_whatsapp_credential_id",
          "name": "WhatsApp Cloud API account"
        }
      }
    },
